# Next Level Gaming & Esports Arena - Website

## Description

The Next Level Gaming & Esports Arena website is a web-based platform designed to provide customers with information about the gaming and esports arena in Johannesburg.

The website allows users to explore gaming packages, gaming experiences, booking options, quotations and account-related information.

The website is designed to provide customers with an easy way to learn about the available services and interact with Next Level Gaming & Esports Arena online.

## Features

- Home page
- User login
- User registration
- Gaming packages
- Package details
- Gaming experiences
- Experience details
- Online booking
- Quotation calculation
- My bookings
- User profile
- Contact and business information

## Technologies Used

- HTML
- CSS
- JavaScript

## Requirements

- A modern web browser such as:
  - Google Chrome
  - Microsoft Edge
  - Mozilla Firefox
- Code editor such as Visual Studio Code
- Internet connection

## Installation

1. Download or clone the project.
2. Open the project folder.
3. Open the project in Visual Studio Code or another code editor.
4. Make sure all HTML, CSS and JavaScript files are in their correct folders.
5. Open the main HTML file in a web browser.
6. Alternatively, use the Live Server extension in Visual Studio Code to run the website.

## Usage

1. Open the Next Level Gaming & Esports Arena website.
2. Browse the home page.
3. Register for an account or log in.
4. Browse the available gaming packages.
5. Select a package to view its details.
6. Browse the available gaming experiences.
7. Select an experience to view its details.
8. Complete the booking information.
9. View the quotation.
10. Access booking and profile information where applicable.

